<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">There are, you suspect, quite a few folk w=
ith links to the London postcode of N17 who would be thoroughly grateful if=
 Troy Parrott could stop popping up to score winning goals for a bit. The R=
epublic of Ireland striker has barely unpacked his bags at Real Betis, yet =
he=E2=80=99s already ruined the afternoon of his former manager at Tottenha=
m, pouncing to sink<a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c=
/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBgtjhYSJYcaNsDra0BxnPgmeSpF=
qlMVAip-qLJDGNfV20CQTv7oeN5UOFvk5h_0MWFMDPLNBif2hNB-eYYLfA1wUZKQ29OOPLq2WMT=
2mWbJ3CruCYDodUvSp3vrKd80RY0fSLFgi6DBSO8wwMcEORPIQFuVxaX9ozoBMAgjxZ9-pQz_rT=
YHTCJIywCprYgYhhlsjWGT-HkAE6Ek-4-WXw20lJk9KQYc-6FgopiBU09om_WDIBF6rYoNW0-o8=
SLC44m3iSsGujdGoo3hS9iGnnsYo4q1uqhflCQRREGggPGVg/4tw/mTJVNDImSDSucw2doi2t_Q=
/h29/h001.v4iVbHIdUu5DmKKkUKeI-AD5nti4lWOupOccXzmbMe4" style=3D"color: #007=
7B6;"> Jos=C3=A9 Mourinho=E2=80=99s Real Madrid</a>. Four days later? He ma=
de headlines again on his <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.c=
om/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBjH7mDHKy8NLTHPhsGN9=
KVsbMbycVRuN0SXwpk6Hdl-pcSnRC9tuhHXZAcwC4zoT_M7POISqjWVZbk2s9DVZrMmKMwAj-3i=
Tz5T0r4obl_Ml9AjMuSxXVb3V6vUd75L7TK5c3VHp-OZiHZiN_NCyL_0x0Y4AOevjjHy2zwDeJU=
K1WSimX-fxuL_5f7_jn9CbK6M_gqKQQhtLLTlpel2swC5UILoRF6ldwX7VxVo-yv-4bKZ4XjyMX=
e4uUiXuYgtyQQk60E8g_0Zr9cLMHTcjoBD-RFzRh9kZtDFpP_Yo3RpZ6N4oJkzOL_zG2zPzDQgQ=
n2yKrzmKIpNbpSyRXcqnUyzmoE5J_Pze-Yu15dit5cI_f7_jjRWOaWvJuQmVDd0ZeOZXfmQQ9O2=
sXwh7l-M99I/4tw/mTJVNDImSDSucw2doi2t_Q/h30/h001.Ff_bHKPdmZSy89Z6bic4noxJfTC=
eDbHVj3SV5aKbgEE" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">Bigger Cup debut at Lille</a>. =
Two games, two goals, two match-winners. Not entirely shabby for a lad who =
was once given the classic Mourinho treatment and declared =E2=80=9Cnot rea=
dy=E2=80=9D. Mourinho, as ever, remains a central character in this particu=
lar soap opera. It was the Special One who handed a teenage Parrott his Pre=
mier League debut in December 2019, throwing him on during a <a href=3D"htt=
ps://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ=
7fIEMgszcCSneHECzMA3M_vNoZYMbp2QFaK37VHo6lRP4Od673Ano5SdEJJhjffNLiCbGrA7Ymt=
OA4fc5UpTk-Qa--fmtgREF0kOHIiYKcPHzZQxEUnD4-Ruck9X0gf-zVKRergHdWL20wwglWvb_A=
ruKLdKL0ZP33RGMBT-h0T6yEWZhd4tbMWLe83PNYjs01G6uuaOeqU2YseWCREOGAAtwBbmTedlR=
NWYZ3qQzdbxYUjd-4Sg_4Jfh0OAINzuORtC1LA5vXNjmWxE/4tw/mTJVNDImSDSucw2doi2t_Q/=
h31/h001.tj13DNZNisSi8KHSOxv1Zpq_7saLRPxyIM-Cjnc1hVM" style=3D"color: #0077=
B6;">5-0 win over Burnley</a>. It was also Mourinho who promptly decided th=
e youngster needed a fair bit longer in the oven.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">When Harry Kane and Son Heung-min were bot=
h sidelined in March 2020, Tottenham fans dared to dream that Parrott might=
 get a go. Instead, Mourinho simply declared that the youngster was not pre=
pared for the cut and thrust of regular top-flight football. A brief cameo =
against Norwich followed before the pandemic halted the season =E2=80=93 an=
d, for all intents and purposes, Parrott=E2=80=99s Spurs career. What follo=
wed was the classic, harrowing English loan circuit: Millwall, Ipswich, MK =
Dons and Preston. Ouch. None of them quite took. The Spurs academy hope was=
 beginning to look less like the next Kane and more like another promising =
youngster destined to become a pub quiz answer. Enter the Netherlands. A fo=
rmative spell at Excelsior steadying the ship was followed by a proper expl=
osion at AZ, where he smashed in 51 goals across 97 games =E2=80=93 giving =
<a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuif=
c_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEB8pAdfUJGH_TIiYQYLGktbwIra436pkSsTV-xoAyk89n1j=
1slxHctU6R0wO-3S8BeTX6-ZjKO01R5efyg3nAYUxl-BLVHWmUzqZTx8sCktdDte-PDXXHquWBu=
Gf6K7uercgNNFcLNxqYUvEDftcw_3T1zL8gupe5i6jWmugWKj88DZIWYm8vJXwMOv4M6EhfmhIo=
gBhKM2d_xFJYOE21rPeOau3agE_DpfSkFdWLdoAriOB059yGocqR1Lmfs9shfcaOcMv2dqnjAWP=
9tCc6dc/4tw/mTJVNDImSDSucw2doi2t_Q/h32/h001.g7em8NJABMSoObUwobXRlgFrDQe7iXy=
H5--AjnL0n40" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">Robin van Persie nightmares</a> alo=
ng the way.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">That =E2=80=93 and a <a href=3D"https://ab=
link.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgs=
