y News</em> reported that Arbroath=E2=80=99s keeper =E2=80=98neither touche=
d the ball with hand or foot =E2=80=A6 but remained under the friendly shel=
ter of an umbrella the whole time=E2=80=99. Arbroath also had seven goals d=
isallowed. Unsurprisingly, the qualification rules for the Scottish Cup wer=
e changed for the following season=E2=80=9D =E2=80=93 Jamie Gaukroger.</p><=
