<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Marc Overmars is stepping down as Royal An=
twerp=E2=80=99s sports director due to health issues. =E2=80=9CYou all know=
 that my health has not been optimal,=E2=80=9D he told supporters in a lett=
er. =E2=80=9CBut now I feel very clearly that I can no longer cope with thi=
s hectic, stressful professional life. My energy is now completely depleted=
